---
kind: lore
id: places
title: Around the rock
---

<beat id="lanternAgain" on="explore" target="place.lantern" once="false">
  @narrator: The lens turns on its bed of mercury, patient, enormous. The log waits on the desk.
</beat>

<beat id="galleryAgain" on="explore" target="place.gallery" once="false">
  @narrator: Wind, iron, and the gap where the rail should be. You keep one hand on the lantern glass.
</beat>

<beat id="landingAgain" on="explore" target="place.landing" once="false">
  @narrator: The tide has turned. The chain groans in its ring.
</beat>

<beat id="cottageAgain" on="explore" target="place.cottage" once="false">
  @narrator: The stove has gone cold again.
</beat>

<beat id="villageAgain" on="explore" target="place.village" once="false">
  @narrator: Curtains move as you pass. Nobody comes out.
</beat>

<beat id="thoughtsAlibi" on="nightfall" title="Thinking it over" when="holds(liar(maren)) && !holds(onRock(ada, midnight))">
  @inspector{mono}: Maren lied for someone. People lie for family.
</beat>

<beat id="thoughtsFigure" on="nightfall" title="Thinking it over" when="holds(misidentified(tobias, elias, dawn))">
  @inspector{mono}: Tobias did not lie. He saw a coat on the landing and put a dead man inside it.
</beat>

<beat id="thoughtsSuspect" on="nightfall" for="kind:person" title="Thinking it over" once="false" when="holds(suspect(occasion.target))">
  @inspector{mono}: {{occasion.target}}. The island has already hanged them in its mind. I have not, yet.
</beat>

<beat id="fogOver" on="explore" target="kind:place" also once="false" when="run.weather == 'fog'">
  @narrator: Fog stands in {{occasion.target}} like wet wool. The foghorn groans somewhere below.
</beat>
